WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:08,480
There's a very wrong human being here.

2
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:09,560
He has a prop in his hand

3
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:11,760
A single touch will make the ghost doctor lose his power instantly

4
00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:14,040
He took away all the finished medicines of my men.

5
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:18,740
why

6
00:00:18,740 --> 00:00:20,020
It just became a copy today

7
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:21,140
I want to see the specific situation

8
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:22,540
I'll sort out the information and report it.

9
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:52,460
no props

10
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:55,620
Did you come out of a mental hospital?

11
00:00:55,620 --> 00:00:57,740
You are one of six people alive

12
00:00:58,300 --> 00:00:59,940
The team leader and the others are gone.
